  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into sticks.\n• Roughly chop baby cos lettuce.\n• Zest lime to get a generous pinch, then cut into wedges.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c186083f90c073aba9f0a/step-b0b52500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c186083f90c073aba9f0a/step-8d31a710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine sweet chilli sauce and lime zest in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cos lettuce, torn mint leaves, a squeeze of lime juiceand a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c186083f90c073aba9f0a/step-e3558020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Top tortillas with some garlic aioli, mint salad, cucumber and satay tofu.\n• Drizzle over sesame dressing.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and serve with sweet chilli sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c186083f90c073aba9f0a/step-bb39f030.jpg"
    }
  ]
